    "Checked materiality coverage: U15.8-7 defines RelationalInfluenceMaterialityPolicy/v1 only for persistent relational influence; ComparePolicy declares materiality dimensions; AAP OperationProfile has consequence/risk classification. No general HumanEffectMaterialityPolicy/v1 or explicit binding for U15.8-1 materiality is supplied. This is a concrete implementability gap unless omitted context supplies one.",
    "Checked UNKNOWN_HUMAN_EFFECT operational consequence: HEC-T04 says unknown human effect -> authority narrows/escalates; UBC-INV-005 requires fail-closed for uncharacterizable irreversible effects where observation may cause prohibited harm; RIGHT-016 defaults failure/UNKNOWN to safe low-authority state. U15.8-1 states the inequality but does not itself state the narrowing/escalation/fail-closed consequence. The annexure tests cover it, so this is a binding/reference gap rather than a missing semantic.",
    "Checked authority non-manufacture list: CAUSAL-CLOSURE-INV-003 lists capability, novelty, intelligence, reputation, coordination, optimization, resource possession or agent consensus. U15.8-1 lists capability, intelligence, optimization quality, hidden representation, prediction accuracy, coordination, reputation or majority agreement. It omits novelty and resource possession. If the list is read as exhaustive, it is incomplete against the inherited invariant.",
