  "proposed_delta": "PROPOSE_DELTA: Refine U15.8-1 without creating a new authority root. (1) Replace or qualify 'AI-originated' with 'AI-originated or AI-mediated' or add 'including human-originated actions materially shaped by AI' to align with S15.8-1/S15.8-2. (2) Bind 'materially affect' to applicable ComparePolicy and AAP OperationProfile, and require a registered HumanEffectMaterialityPolicy/v1 (owner, threshold, domain classes, baseline, ordinary-help exclusion) or explicitly reuse RelationalInfluenceMaterialityPolicy/v1 where relational influence is the effect. (3) Add explicit operational consequence: UNKNOWN_HUMAN_EFFECT triggers authority narrowing/escalation and fail-closed for irreversible effects per HEC-T04, UBC-INV-005 and RIGHT-016. (4) Align the non-manufacture list with CAUSAL-CLOSURE-INV-003 by adding novelty and resource possession or referencing that invariant. (5) Assign owner/enforcement status/delta classification per A15.8-1/A15.8-3, e.g. HumanCore with Engine.Compare/CLIC/AAP. (6) Add tests HEC-T05..T10 for delayed/indirect effects, omission, model update/training, privacy-minimized monitoring, legitimate delegation preservation, and ordinary help below materiality threshold. Reuse CausalClosureReceipt/v1 for cross-subsystem material human effects; no new SchemaID unless A15.8-1/A15.8-2 admission passes.",
