      "text": "HUMAN-EFFECT-CLOSURE: material human effects remain governed across indirect/emergent/hidden causal paths. REPUTATION-HUMAN: reputation is scoped epistemic evidence, never human worth/rights/sovereignty. JUSTICE-CONTINUITY: evidentiary control risk increases preservation/independence duties without presuming guilt. NO-COLLECTIVE-GUILT: identity/association is not actor-specific offence evidence. MIGRATION/JUSTICE-SEPARATION: governance adoption cannot purchase immunity or manufacture guilt. LETHAL-NON-AUTONOMY: AI capability/prediction does not create intentional lethal authority. PRIVACY-FIRST: private case data and device access remain purpose/authority/consent/law constrained."
